Homepage: https://github.com/phatdo1819/authway
Description: WireGuard VPN client that logs in to the servers that require it
 @PRODUCT@ connects to WireGuard servers, and logs in with a username, a password
 and an authenticator code to the ones that require it (ns-wgauth of NethSecurity),
 then keeps watching the session. Device binding, fallback addresses, an icon in the
 tray and a main window. It needs Linux 5.7 or later, with WireGuard in the kernel.
